{"parentUuid":"bf37c408-a93e-4337-b753-0a40a972074a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch4LH3FAaRptAqus66Gi8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I pushed the `v1.2.0` tag (signed, verified good) on the promotion commit `f1ad33b9`. That commit is rc.1 (`cc82b5ee`) plus the version change only, and `check-version-only-diff.mjs` passes. The release workflow (run `43690861483`) is in progress. It is not published yet: the release is a draft until I verify the assets and the install, and I'll check with you before publishing it.\n\nYou chose \"accept and record\" for G1.1-4. The gate was not met: `lead-reasoning` was 195/200 on rc.1, against a 99.5% bar, and `engineering/deep` was 200/200.\n- **Failures:** all five are the \"think before the call\" `edit_file` prompts, where the model reasons to the 8192-token cap and never calls the tool.\n- **Probe:** the six probe calls, three with `tool_choice: required` and three with `auto`, all ended `finish_reason=length` with no call.\n- **Recorded unaltered:** the evidence is in a docs PR with the three runs, the diagnostics, and updated rc.1 and stable notes. It closes v1.2.1 MQ-0. The stable notes already in the tag still say the measurement is \"in the rc notes\", so I'll add the limitation to the draft release body before publishing.\n\nStill open:\n- **After the release:** check its assets and install. Then a follow-up docs PR moves `LATEST`, the README pins and the CHANGELOG date, which waits on #514.\n- **PRs in CI:** #514 and #519 (with its two fixes).\n- **Claims log:** the gateway claim from the probe is released and the tag push is logged.\n\nThe next check is set for 08:04."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":351,"cache_read_input_tokens":225720,"output_tokens":557,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search