{"parentUuid":"3ee507d0-3d54-4ab5-851b-994fa572554a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch4LJt1MLR7u1ut4wPYtE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The hook is right that the stop condition isn't met, and I agree with its reading. Nothing is published, G1.1-4 is recorded as not met, and the notes make no frontier-grade claim, which I won't change. External qualification is still pending.\n\nThe release workflow's `package` job started at 07:38Z and is still running, at about 07:40Z. Last time this took roughly 30 minutes. Nothing I can do speeds it up, so I'm waiting for it. The 08:04 check will do this in order:\n- **Workflow result:** read the status and conclusion, not just that it finished.\n- **Assets and install:** verify the assets and checksums, and run the install check.\n- **Draft notes:** add the G1.1-4 limitation to the draft release body.\n- **Publishing:** ask you before publishing the draft, since only you have authorised that for v1.1.4.\n- **Follow-up and PRs:** the post-stable docs PR, and merging #514, #519 and the evidence PR as their CI goes green."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":178,"cache_read_input_tokens":227183,"output_tokens":328,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":178,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":328,"cache_read_input_tokens":227183,"cache_creation_input_tokens":178,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":178},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Ch4LJsijbMbuNRV2243kK","req